    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/6268b9d38e3d9fe7f41f20f11ae192f6.avif?t=1749512711\" width=570 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barks &amp; Bytes</strong> is an online 4-players horror card game featuring voice chat, where robots bluff, swap, and outsmart each other to dodge the dreaded Dog Card. Experience different game modes steeped in dread where deception is the only lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/1f9c3b9299ba63ec0654639fbbeaac86.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deception is your key to survival...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use text or voice chat as your weapon; make friends, lie, bluff, and outsmart everyone else at the card table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/efc383e3cffe45cf11180d88d7b709e1.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay off the dog\u2019s radar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Game mode has its own set of rules, your only concern is to avoid ending up on the dog's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/9b6bd4e24553c8a021d8777f8459abaf.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>How to Play:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Initial Discard:</strong> After all cards are dealt, each player discards any matching pairs in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Turn Flow:</strong> Players offer up to two cards face-down for the next player to pick; if that player doesn\u2019t trust them, they can request a third card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Pairing:</strong> Whenever you collect a pair, discard it immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Objective:</strong> Discard your hand as quickly as possible, while avoiding the Dog Card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Loss condition:</strong> At round\u2019s end, whoever is stuck with the Dog Card is eliminated. Rounds repeat with remaining players until one survivor remains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Additional Game modes will be added.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/6268b9d38e3d9fe7f41f20f11ae192f6.avif?t=1749512711\" width=570 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barks &amp; Bytes</strong> is an online 4-players horror card game featuring voice chat, where robots bluff, swap, and outsmart each other to dodge the dreaded Dog Card. Experience different game modes steeped in dread where deception is the only lifeline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/1f9c3b9299ba63ec0654639fbbeaac86.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/8ce7f58019dabc8b1f44d90d03121e66.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deception is your key to survival...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use text or voice chat as your weapon; make friends, lie, bluff, and outsmart everyone else at the card table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/efc383e3cffe45cf11180d88d7b709e1.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/d9f8e08d94fbfcd33a389380ae42e348.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay off the dog\u2019s radar!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Game mode has its own set of rules, your only concern is to avoid ending up on the dog's menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/9b6bd4e24553c8a021d8777f8459abaf.avif?t=1749512711\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.poster.avif?t=1749512711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.webm?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701830/extras/f2bb91e3164ea4b19376605f0b0ac7e9.mp4?t=1749512711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>How to Play:</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Initial Discard:</strong> After all cards are dealt, each player discards any matching pairs in hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Turn Flow:</strong> Players offer up to two cards face-down for the next player to pick; if that player doesn\u2019t trust them, they can request a third card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Pairing:</strong> Whenever you collect a pair, discard it immediately.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Objective:</strong> Discard your hand as quickly as possible, while avoiding the Dog Card.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Loss condition:</strong> At round\u2019s end, whoever is stuck with the Dog Card is eliminated. Rounds repeat with remaining players until one survivor remains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Additional Game modes will be added.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Barks &amp; Bytes is a frantic multiplayer game where Robots bluff, swap, and outsmart each other to dodge the dreaded Dog Card. Plunge into different game modes where deception is the key to survival. Draw, deceive, outplay, and pray you don\u2019t end up as dog food...",
